31:["$","section","English-taught programmes",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"English-taught programmes"}],[["$","p","Affordable study options in several countries",{"children":"Affordable study options in several countries"}],["$","p","Multicultural exposure",{"children":"Multicultural exposure"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
32:["$","section","Post-study work options in many countries",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Post-study work options in many countries"}],[["$","p","Access to strong industries and international companies",{"children":"Access to strong industries and international companies"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
33:["$","section","High-quality lifestyle and student experience",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"High-quality lifestyle and student experience"}],[["$","p","Europe offers a wide range of choices for students with different budgets, academic profiles, and career goals.",{"children":"Europe offers a wide range of choices for students with different budgets, academic profiles, and career goals."}],["$","p","Europe is a strong destination for master’s programmes because it offers specialised courses, research opportunities, practical learning, international classrooms, and strong industry exposure.",{"children":"Europe is a strong destination for master’s programmes because it offers specialised courses, research opportunities, practical learning, international classrooms, and strong industry exposure."}],["$","p","Many European master’s programmes are designed to connect academic learning with employability. Students can choose from fields such as business, engineering, data science, finance, hospitality, public policy, sustainability, healthcare, artificial intelligence, cybersecurity, and international management.",{"children":"Many European master’s programmes are designed to connect academic learning with employability. Students can choose from fields such as business, engineering, data science, finance, hospitality, public policy, sustainability, healthcare, artificial intelligence, cybersecurity, and international management."}],["$","p","For Indian students, a master’s in Europe can be a valuable pathway to global education, career development, and international exposure.",{"children":"For Indian students, a master’s in Europe can be a valuable pathway to global education, career development, and international exposure."}],["$","p","France is one of Europe’s leading destinations for business and management education. It is home to several well-known business schools and offers programmes in management, luxury brand management, international business, finance, marketing, hospitality, and entrepreneurship.",{"children":"France is one of Europe’s leading destinations for business and management education. It is home to several well-known business schools and offers programmes in management, luxury brand management, international business, finance, marketing, hospitality, and entrepreneurship."}],["$","p","France also has strong connections with global companies, especially in sectors such as luxury, fashion, finance, consulting, technology, hospitality, and international trade.",{"children":"France also has strong connections with global companies, especially in sectors such as luxury, fashion, finance, consulting, technology, hospitality, and international trade."}],["$","p","For students interested in management careers, France can offer a strong combination of academic quality, industry exposure, and European business culture.",{"children":"For students interested in management careers, France can offer a strong combination of academic quality, industry exposure, and European business culture."}],["$","p","Students can contact One Window Overseas Education through the official website, enquiry form, email, phone number, or social media channels. The counselling team can help with Europe study options, university shortlisting, course selection, visa guidance, documentation, and application support.",{"children":"Students can contact One Window Overseas Education through the official website, enquiry form, email, phone number, or social media channels. The counselling team can help with Europe study options, university shortlisting, course selection, visa guidance, documentation, and application support."}],"$L46","$L47","$L48","$L49","$L4a","$L4b","$L4c","$L4d","$L4e"],"$L4f"]}]
